msgid ""
"The parameters could not be estimated. The %s distribution requires all "
"measurements to be greater than zero. Consider a transformation that yields "
"positive measurements."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"For capability estimates, consider the 3-parameter Weibull if a lower "
"threshold is appropriate for the process."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The parameters could not be estimated for the selected distribution, most "
"likely because the observed distribution of the data are very far away from "
"the selected distribution, please try one that describes your data more "
"closely."
msgstr ""
"選択した分布ではパラメータを推定できませんでした。観測された分布が選択した分"
"布と大きく異なることが原因と考えられます。"

msgid ""
"The parameters could not be estimated: the historical threshold (%1$s) must "
"be smaller than the smallest observation (%2$s)."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"It can only equal the smallest observation with a historical shape of 1 "
"(shifted exponential distribution)."
msgstr ""

