msgid ""
"AIC selection in coded units. Tests and intervals do not account for model "
"selection."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The model is saturated (no error degrees of freedom) and its effects are not "
"available in uncoded units, because coding changes the model."
msgstr ""
"モデルが飽和しており (誤差の自由度なし)、コード化によってモデルが変わるため、"
"非コード化の単位では効果を使えません。"

msgid ""
"The model is saturated (no error degrees of freedom). Lenth's method for "
"assessing its effects applies to two-level factorial terms only, but the "
"model has squared terms or terms of discrete factors with more than two "
"levels."
msgstr ""
"モデルが飽和しています (誤差の自由度なし)。効果を評価する Lenth の方法は2水準"
"の要因の項にのみ適用できますが、このモデルには2乗項か、3水準以上の離散要因の"
"項があります。"

msgid ""
"Lenth's method requires orthogonal two-level effects with equal precision."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The model is saturated (no error degrees of freedom) and Lenth's pseudo "
"standard error of its effects is zero, so the effects cannot be assessed."
msgstr ""
"モデルが飽和しており (誤差の自由度なし)、効果の Lenth の擬似標準誤差が0である"
