msgid ""
"%1$s cannot be analysed: after leaving out its runs with a missing value, "
"the factor %2$s has fewer than 2 levels left."
msgid_plural ""
"%1$s cannot be analysed: after leaving out its runs with a missing value, "
"the factors %2$s have fewer than 2 levels left."
msgstr[0] ""

msgid ""
"%1$d run with a missing value of a predictor, block or covariate was left "
"out of the analysis of all responses."
