"%1$d runs with a missing value of a predictor, block or covariate were left "
"out of the analysis of all responses."
msgstr[0] ""

msgid ""
"%1$d run with a missing value of %2$s was left out of the analysis of this "
"response."
msgid_plural ""
"%1$d runs with a missing value of %2$s were left out of the analysis of this "
"response."
msgstr[0] ""

msgid ""
"The response optimizer cannot be used because the response %1$s could not be "
"analysed, see its output."
msgid_plural ""
"The response optimizer cannot be used because the responses %1$s could not "
"be analysed, see their output."
msgstr[0] ""

msgid "The following covariate was considered but not included: %1$s."
msgid_plural "The following covariates were considered but not included: %1$s."
msgstr[0] "次の共変量は検討されましたが、含まれませんでした: %1$s。"

msgid ""
"The main effect %1$s was retained to respect marginality (its squared term "
"is in the model)."
msgid_plural ""
"The main effects %1$s were retained to respect marginality (their squared "
"terms are in the model)."
msgstr[0] ""
"主効果 %1$s は、周辺性を保つために残されました(その2乗項がモデルに含まれてい"
"るため)。"

msgid ""
"The Box-Cox transformation requires measurement + shift > 0, but %1$i "
"measurement is smaller than or equal to -shift (%2$s). Increase the shift or "
"use the Yeo-Johnson or Johnson transformation."
msgid_plural ""
"The Box-Cox transformation requires measurement + shift > 0, but %1$i "
"measurements are smaller than or equal to -shift (%2$s). Increase the shift "
"or use the Yeo-Johnson or Johnson transformation."
msgstr[0] ""

